      <data key="d17">CHG-EUAIACT-UPLOAD</data>
      <data key="d9">REG-EUAIACT</data>
      <data key="d18">Provide effective human oversight for high-risk AI decisions, including clear escalation paths, authority to override automated outcomes, and evidence that reviewers understand model limitations.</data>
